        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ui): show cron job ids and running state",
        "body": "Restored replacement for #94368 after the fork/head repository was recreated.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Show each cron job's existing stable ID in the Control UI cron list and agent cron panel.\n- Surface running state from `state.runningAtMs` as `Running` / `Not running` instead of only showing last-run status.\n- Add focused coverage for both the cron page and agent cron panel.\n\nCloses #67629\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run ui/src/ui/views/cron.test.ts ui/src/ui/views/agents.test.ts --reporter=verbose`\n- `node --import tsx scripts/control-ui-i18n.ts check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nBehavior addressed: Cron job rows expose the existing job identifier and visible running/not-running state in both the Control UI cron list and the agent cron panel.\n\nReal environment tested: Local OpenClaw checkout on this PR branch (`codex/cron-visible-id-running-67629-20260618`) with repository dependencies available, rendering the changed Control UI views through the repository UI test harness.\n\nExact steps or command run after this patch:\n\n```text\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs run ui/src/ui/views/cron.test.ts ui/src/ui/views/agents.test.ts --reporter=verbose\nnode --import tsx scripts/control-ui-i18n.ts check\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nEvidence after fix: Terminal capture from the local OpenClaw UI render run showed the changed DOM behavior:\n\n```text\n✓ |ui| ui/src/ui/views/cron.test.ts > cron view > shows cron job ids and running state in job rows\n✓ |ui| ui/src/ui/views/agents.test.ts > renderAgents > shows cron job ids and running state in the agent cron panel\n\nTest Files  2 passed (2)\nTests  24 passed (24)\n[test] passed 1 Vitest shard in 1.32s\n```\n\nObserved result after fix: The rendered cron view includes `ID: job-running`, `Running`, `ID: job-idle`, and `Not running`; the rendered agent Cron Jobs panel includes `ID: job-beta` and `Running`. The i18n validation completed cleanly for all 18 locales with `changed=false` / `fallbacks=0`, and `git diff --check` produced no output.\n\nWhat was not tested: Browser screenshot proof was not captured in this environment; the focused UI rendering path above verifies the changed DOM output for the affected views.\n\n\n## What Problem This Solves\nCron job rows did not expose the stable job ID or a clear running/not-running state in the Control UI cron list and agent cron panel. This made it harder to correlate visible rows with configured jobs and current execution state.\n\n## Evidence\nFocused UI tests passed after the change: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run ui/src/ui/views/cron.test.ts ui/src/ui/views/agents.test.ts --reporter=verbose`, plus `node --import tsx scripts/control-ui-i18n.ts check` and `git diff --check`. The detailed test output in the Real behavior proof section shows the changed DOM assertions for job IDs and running state. Browser screenshot proof was not captured for this PR.\n",
